WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.505 --> 00:00:13.806
Disgusting garbage piled up on top of Roxy.

2
00:00:14.807 --> 00:00:17.828
"Yuck!" Roxy wiped moldy tomato sauce off her face.

3
00:00:17.848 --> 00:00:19.569
"This is gross!

4
00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:22.611
Bleck!" Roxy pushed garbage away from herself.

5
00:00:23.712 --> 00:00:25.333
More garbage fell down onto her.

6
00:00:25.353 --> 00:00:28.514
"Grr!" Roxy grew angry.

7
00:00:29.415 --> 00:00:31.216
Orange beams radiated from her eyes.

8
00:00:31.888 --> 00:00:34.129
The garbage heated up and then burst into flames.

9
00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:36.631
Roxy quickly burst out of the pile.

10
00:00:37.531 --> 00:00:39.573
She watched the fire burn up all the trash.

11
00:00:39.593 --> 00:00:43.835
"Now I have to find Trashman," Roxy thought.

12
00:00:44.716 --> 00:00:47.297
She flew out of the building and up into the sky.

13
00:00:48.218 --> 00:00:51.019
Looking down, she saw police cars chasing a garbage truck.

14
00:00:51.039 --> 00:00:53.020
"That's Trashman!"

15
00:00:53.421 --> 00:00:54.661
Roxy shot after the truck.

16
00:00:57.483 --> 00:00:58.944
Trashman saw the police cars.

17
00:00:59.688 --> 00:01:02.671
"It's time for one of my garbage bombs!"

18
00:01:03.431 --> 00:01:04.252
He pushed a button.

19
00:01:05.953 --> 00:01:08.716
A huge ball of garbage fired out from the back of the truck.

20
00:01:09.856 --> 00:01:12.058
Ka-boom! The garbage exploded.

21
00:01:12.599 --> 00:01:13.840
The police cars crashed.

22
00:01:14.660 --> 00:01:18.063
"Ha-ha!" Trashman's messy hair waved wildly.

23
00:01:18.083 --> 00:01:20.505
"Ahugh! Ahugh!

24
00:01:20.725 --> 00:01:24.268
Ha-ha!" "Trashman is terrible!"

25
00:01:24.508 --> 00:01:25.189
Roxy thought.

26
00:01:25.209 --> 00:01:28.492
"He doesn't just steal—he litters too!"

27
00:01:29.364 --> 00:01:31.046
Ka-boom! Ka-boom!

28
00:01:31.646 --> 00:01:33.247
More garbage bombs exploded.

29
00:01:35.189 --> 00:01:37.391
An old, ripped sock landed on a man's head.

30
00:01:37.811 --> 00:01:39.432
He shook his fist at the garbage truck.

31
00:01:39.452 --> 00:01:43.576
"Litterbug!" Roxy caught up to the truck.

32
00:01:47.859 --> 00:01:50.862
Ka-boom! A garbage bomb exploded in her face.

33
00:01:50.882 --> 00:01:54.204
"Grr!" Roxy wiped her face.

34
00:01:55.065 --> 00:01:58.408
Suddenly—snap! The truck's claw grabbed Roxy.

35
00:01:59.028 --> 00:02:01.891
Roxy struggled, but the claw squeezed more tightly.

36
00:02:02.471 --> 00:02:04.653
Finally Roxy twisted with all her might.

37
00:02:05.674 --> 00:02:08.176
The truck flipped onto its side and slid to a stop.

38
00:02:09.837 --> 00:02:11.379
Trashman crawled out of the truck.

39
00:02:11.399 --> 00:02:16.283
"You'll never—ahugh—catch me, Rocket Girl!"

40
00:02:18.845 --> 00:02:20.486
Roxy used her super strength.

41
00:02:21.747 --> 00:02:23.589
Slowly she forced the claw to open.

42
00:02:25.130 --> 00:02:27.172
With one tug, she ripped it from the truck.

43
00:02:33.364 --> 00:02:35.785
Zoom! She shot after Trashman.

44
00:02:36.666 --> 00:02:39.127
Snap! Roxy caught the villain with the claw.

45
00:02:40.307 --> 00:02:40.968
Roxy grinned.

46
00:02:40.988 --> 00:02:42.028
"Got you!"

47
00:02:42.869 --> 00:02:43.809
Trashman groaned.

48
00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:47.971
Then he started to cough.

49
00:02:49.251 --> 00:02:50.432
Roxy brought him to jail.

50
00:02:56.695 --> 00:02:58.696
Rocket Girl," Detective Smith said.

51
00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:00.801
"We found the Smart Brothers.

52
00:03:01.121 --> 00:03:03.804
Trashman locked them up so he could take over their job.

53
00:03:04.704 --> 00:03:07.367
Mayor Bloom asked them to start picking up trash right away."

54
00:03:07.387 --> 00:03:09.949
"Good!" Roxy said.

55
00:03:09.969 --> 00:03:14.272
"I'm going home to take a shower!"

56
00:03:16.514 --> 00:03:18.476
The next morning Roxy met her friends at school.

57
00:03:19.476 --> 00:03:20.877
A trash can stood in the lobby.

58
00:03:21.558 --> 00:03:24.020
Smart Brothers' Garbage Pickup was written on the side.

59
00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:27.643
"Roxy, did you go home sick yesterday?"

60
00:03:27.923 --> 00:03:28.564
Mara asked.

61
00:03:29.564 --> 00:03:30.845
"Yep," Roxy said.

62
00:03:30.865 --> 00:03:32.286
"But guess what.

63
00:03:32.887 --> 00:03:35.429
I saw Rocket Girl on my way home yesterday.

64
00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:38.912
She was fighting a villain and burning up trash!"

65
00:03:38.932 --> 00:03:41.474
"Cool!" Jack said.

66
00:03:42.175 --> 00:03:43.376
Terrell just smiled.
